{"product_id":"vampirates-tide-of-terror-vampirates-2","title":"Vampirates: Tide of Terror (Vampirates, 2)","description":"\u003cp\u003eIn this sequel to Vampirates: Demons of the Ocean, there's a traitor aboard the Diablo and enemies at every turn. As the danger intensifies, Grace discovers a place where her twin brother Connor could learn more about the pirate way without risking his life: the elite Pirate Academy. Will Connor choose an education by sea or by school, and will Grace be forced to follow him wherever he goes?\u003cbr\u003e\nDimensions: 133 x 194\u003cbr\u003e\nAuthor: Justin Somper\u003cbr\u003e\nISBN: 9780316014458\u003cbr\u003e\nFormat: Paperback\u003cbr\u003e\nPages: 480\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"bookhero.ae","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":45434481049753,"sku":"12RC9780316014458","price":10.0,"currency_code":"AED","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0580\/5696\/6297\/files\/683b155148906_Vampirates-_Tide_of_Terror__Vampirates__2__Justin_Somper.jpg?v=1752084399","url":"https:\/\/bookhero.ae\/products\/vampirates-tide-of-terror-vampirates-2","provider":"Dubai - Buy Used\/Second-Hand Books - BookHero","version":"1.0","type":"link"}